  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 51818782720
    m_Localized: <Editor>editor@clearrun.fake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51839754240
    m_Localized: <Holy Warrior> lv01@msn.com
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51839754241
    m_Localized: <Manasoft> Manasoft@msn.com
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51839754242
    m_Localized: '[Worlds Movie Weaver] Celebrating the Rise of the Holy Warrior'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531456
    m_Localized: "This email is exclusively sent to members who have agreed to receive
      advertisement notifications.\n\nPromotion Target: Members of Manasoft Worlds
      Movie Weaver Free (Personal Use)\nPromotion Period: 5 days starting today\nPromotion
      Details:\nGain access to the paid feature \u201CSFX\u201D for free during the
      promotion period! One conversion per every campaign day!\n\nThe following functions
      are included in the promotion:\n\nNeed speed? Perfect for swift mobility. <b>Haste!</b>\nFast.
      Powerful. Spectacular. <b>Damage Boost!</b>\nThe one and only devastating smite.
      <b>Crit Hit!</b>\nThe new meta, back by popular demand! <b>Stun!</b>\n\n30%
      discount on Manasoft Worlds Movie Weaver (VAT included. Annual or monthly billing)\nFind
      additional information about this promotion <u>here.</u>\n\n<u>Click here to
      claim your offer!</u>\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531457
    m_Localized: Warrior Video
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531458
    m_Localized: "This is the warrior\nLooking forward to working with you on the
      channel.\n\nFor now, please edit the dungeon\u2019s 1st floor walkthrough video
      and send it over by the end of the day\nYou know the first video\u2019s views
      count the most, so try to make it realistic as possible\nMake it look lifelike
      and convincing enough so that no one gets sus\n\nattachment \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531459
    m_Localized: '[Worlds Movie Weaver] Information on connection delays'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531460
    m_Localized: "Due to excessive traffic on the promotion page, access may be temporarily
      limited.\r\n\r\nMaintenance Period: Today, 07:00\u201324:00\r\nThe promotion
      period will be extended by 1 day(for a total of 6 days).\r\nEnjoy various special
      effects during the additional days provided!\r\n\r\nThank you for your understanding.\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531461
    m_Localized: The video qu
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531462
    m_Localized: "The video quality is amazing, already got a whole 10 million views\nPlease
      edit the dungeon 2nd floor walkthrough as well.\nmake it scarier than yesterday
      though\n\nAs you see in the docs, I did train since 5 years old and wielding
      a sword isn\u2019t a big deal but\u2026 fiends start training at 5 months after
      birth and like\nTaking that much risk just isn\u2019t very entertaining, so
      I think it\u2019s better to leave the visuals to you\n\nattachment \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531463
    m_Localized: Thnaks agai
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531464
    m_Localized: "Thnaks again for yesterday's video\nJust like yesterday, please
      work on the 3rd floor version.\n \nIt seems the video kind of went viral among
      the dungeons\nFiends are so full of themselves, they\u2019ll probably stop
      watching soon anyway\nThis is just between us but my plan is to draw aggro
      and make the lord totally forget about kidnapping anyone\n\nattachment \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531465
    m_Localized: ' if tx fails again im nuking manasoft'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531466
    m_Localized: "Everyone's losing it over the goblin scene, and honestly, even
      I think it\u2019s pretty cool lol\nplus the dark lord subscribed to my channel
      too\n\nThe dark lord knows their castle too well, so this video needs to look
      more real than ever.\nPlease do your best as always!\n\nattachment \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531467
    m_Localized: hey it worke
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531468
    m_Localized: hey it worked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531469
    m_Localized: (No Subject)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531470
    m_Localized: "shouldn\u2019t you have told me earlier if the lord was waiting
      here?\r\nI tried to film the 5th floor but the stairs collapsed and nearly
      crushed me\r\nI\u2019d be caught if I stayed here any longer and you know what\r\njust
      make a video of me fighting them and meeting my end ok\r\nlower the video quality
      and it will be finnnnnnnnnnnn\r"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531471
    m_Localized: Quick Update on the Video
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531472
    m_Localized: "Have you already started working on it?\nThe Dark Lord paid me
      a visit\nActually the lord said it was impressive to see editing skills like
      this after 300 years so now they want to look cool in the video too\nthey suggested
      something like this sneaky demon king concept that stabs you in the back, with
      some detailed breath attack VFXs\nWell, for now, we settled on a 100-year \u201Cno
      resurrection\u201D clause and started shooting the vids\n\nabout halfway through,
      we thought it'd look cooler if we ran up the stairs to fight\nThe next meeting
      should be at this time tomorrow, so please make sure today's editing if finished
      before then.\n\nattachment \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531473
    m_Localized: Final Video
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531474
    m_Localized: "This will be the final video.\r\n\r\nOnce it\u2019s uploaded, I\u2019ll
      be doing a live stream on the channel for the orichalcum button award ceremony.\r\nApparently
      I\u2019m the first one to receive the button in just 7 days lol\r\nHonestly,
      it\u2019s all thanks to your editing.\r\nIf you ever make it to the royal castle
      later on, I\u2019ll make sure to treat you in a proper manner.\n\nattachment
      \n[ENTER_LINK]"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531475
    m_Localized: '[Worlds Movie Weaver] Notice of End of 30% Discount'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51856531476
    m_Localized: "The Manasoft Worlds Movie Weaver 30% special promotion is ending
      soon. Don\u2019t worry, we\u2019re offering an even higher discount rate. Click
      below to claim your discount.\n\n<u>Click here to claim your BETTER offer!</u>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
